// =============================================================================
// iSCSI Service - iSCSI Storage Target Management
// =============================================================================
// Purpose: Manages iSCSI storage connectivity on agent nodes. Used for
// connecting to SAN storage and using iSCSI LUNs as VM disks.
//
// Communication: Unary RPC for all operations
//
// Key Operations:
// - Discover: Scan for available iSCSI targets on a portal
// - Login/Logout: Connect/disconnect from iSCSI targets
// - DeleteNode: Remove persistent iSCSI node configuration
// - Rescan: Refresh SCSI bus after configuration changes
// - Sessions: List active iSCSI sessions
// - Nodes: List configured iSCSI nodes
// - GetLuns: Get available LUNs from a target
// - GetPaths: Get device paths (including multipath)
// - CHAP Auth: Configure CHAP authentication (inbound/outbound)
// =============================================================================

